      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "So this would be a huge issue to cause players to spaz out constantly as trackers do not track perfectly even on the best of days. Even if you don't notice it, your trackers will fly off for a split second and come back without you realizing it. If the avatar froze for every time that happened you would find yourself getting more annoyed than anything",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
