      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5b9ab9ce22d5f33c2c26c00f|full_name}: Both systems tracking uses the infra-red spectrum for tracking. The colour of your room makes no difference. For Oculus the main issue is glare from natural light washing out it's constellation image based tracking or blinding the sensors. For Vive the main issue is reflective surfaces disrupting the pulsed laser sweeps.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
