  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2019-02-25T16:58:37.687Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "As SteamVR returns trackers to 0, 0 co-ordinates (as far as I know) when their tracking is lost, this causes full body players in game to fly across the world.\nA better solution for this would be great, maybe freeze a player in their current location until tracking is regained?\nI know SteamVR allows you to check if tracking is lost, but I'm not sure if it has already thrown the trackers across the play space before showing tracking is lost in the SDK.\nThis feature would be nice if it is possible though! :)",
